## Features

### Multi-Camera Support
- Automatically detects all available cameras
- Defaults to back/environment camera on mobile devices
- Camera switching button appears when multiple cameras available
- Seamless switching without closing modal

### High Performance
- Uses native Barcode Detection API (hardware accelerated)
- Configurable camera resolution (up to 1920x1080)
- Continuous autofocus support
- 30 FPS frame rate
- Graceful fallback for unsupported constraints

### User Experience
- Visual frame overlay for guidance
- Success/error feedback messages
- Auto-close on successful scan (configurable)
- Manual close button
- Responsive design (mobile & desktop)
- Dark theme by default

