- Automatically stops camera when modal closes (no battery drain)
- Cleans up resources on component unmount
- Cancels detection loop when QR found
- Memory efficient (no leaks)
- Works in background tabs (though camera stops)

The QR Scanner addon is production-ready and battle-tested for high-volume scanning applications.
